keys: ctrl+end
line: 381
zoom: lines 360-381
spot: line 360
say:
  Every frame repeats once a frame, sixty times a second, until the window is closed.
spot: lines 361-365
say:
  While the game isn't won: read the keys, move across, move up and down, and pick up coins. In that order, every frame.
spot: line 366
say:
  Fall below the screen, or touch a danger, and a life is lost.
spot: line 367
say:
  Every coin, and past the flag: you've won.
spot: lines 369-370
say:
  Running fast on the ground leaves dust. Otherwise the trail fades, one dot each frame.
spot: lines 371-373
say:
  Invoke flying moves each bee in the list, and gives back the moved bee. The queen flies too.
spot: line 374
say:
  The camera follows the player, three hundred and sixty dots from the left of the window, and stops at the level's two ends.
spot: line 376
say:
  And each layer is invoked, back to front.
spot: lines 377-379
say:
  Whenever won becomes yes: the points. Point nine seven to the power of the seconds shrinks the bonus the longer you take. Then meanwhile saves the record alongside, so the game doesn't stop to wait.
spot: lines 380-381
say:
  And every half a second, the flag's blink turns on or off.
