test
zoom: output
say:
  Both scripts' tests pass.
wait
zoom: out
say:
  That's the whole game. It's built into a program of its own, so it runs fast. Let's play it.
game: hop.fathom | hop.keys | Hop!
say:
  Running right, faster each frame. Jumping: up fast, slowing, and falling, as gravity adds point six every frame.
say:
  Over the spikes, under the bees, and every coin. The flag turns green, and blinks. We win, and the record is saved.
until game ends
say:
  And that's how a platform game works: speed changes the place, gravity changes the speed, one direction at a time, and a camera that the whole world is drawn around.
card: Thank you | That's Fathom | Every word is in the list on the left of the studia, and in LANGUAGE.md. Now go and make something of your own.
say:
  That's every part of Fathom. Every word is listed in the studia, and in the language guide. Now it's your turn: go and make something of your own.
pause: 2
